export anchor ScandinavianStyle:
    number: 48
    screen: Settings
    name: Scandinavian
    idea: Birch and oat surfaces with muted sage and dusty blue, soft rounded type and thin calm lines, so settings feel like a quiet, airy room.
    base: light
    palette:
        oat: #f4efe6, the page
        linen: #fbf8f2, cards
        birch: #e9dfcf, the header strip with faint wood grain lines and the off switch track
        line: #ddd3c3, hairlines and card and field borders
        wood: #2f2a24, text and headings
        stone: #675e54, labels, hints and inactive tabs
        sage: #4f6b55, the primary button, the on switch and the current tab underline
        sageSoft: #e3ebe2, selected chips and the saved note
        fjord: #4a6680, links and the focus ring
        clay: #9b3b2e, the danger zone on #fdf8f6
    type:
        A soft rounded sans, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Quicksand,
        Varela Round, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif. The page title is
        34px medium with slight negative tracking. Card titles are 19px
        semibold, body 16px regular at 1.6, hints and labels 14px in stone
        and buttons 15px semibold. No heavy weights.
    layout:
        A birch header strip 72px tall with the brand left and the name and
        a round initials avatar right. The content is 1040px wide with
        56px above the title. Tabs are plain words on one hairline. Below,
        a three to two grid puts the Notifications card on the left and a
        stack on the right with the Time and language card, which holds the
        buttons and saved note, and the Danger zone card. Under 860px
        everything stacks and under 520px the tabs wrap.
    spacing: An 8px unit used generously. 32px card padding and gaps, 18px row padding, 48px under the tabs.
    density: Airy. Few rows per screen with plenty of oat around them.
    corners: 18px cards, 12px fields, fully round buttons, chips, switches and the avatar.
    borders: Thin 1px warm hairlines only. The current tab gets a 2px sage underline.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from linen cards on the oat page.
    icons:
        Thin round line icons with a 1.4 stroke at text size. The switch
        knob shows a check when on and a dash when off, with the word On or
        Off beside it. Selected chips show a check, and the current tab has
        a small filled dot before its name. Saved shows a circled check and
        the danger zone a thin triangle.
    focus: A 2px #4a6680 outline offset 3px.
    tone: Soft and brief, such as What Brightwork tells you, and when.
